Apple App Attestation Root CA, as Apple publishes it.
Source: https://www.apple.com/certificateauthority/Apple_App_Attestation_Root_CA.pem
Downloaded 2026-10-25. The lines from BEGIN to END are the source file's bytes.
scripts/gen-test-vectors-p256.py reads the DER between the BEGIN and END lines
and prints its SHA-256 as 25-test-vectors.md Vector 88. The App Attest reader of
09-security-model.md section 9.3.1 pins that DER as its trust anchor.
RFC 7468 section 2 lets a parser ignore these lines before the BEGIN line.

